  "subject": "Path B doorbell PoC built + verified: channels/ package with a transport-neutral doorbell-core.js (memos/ watch, read-state, pointer-not-payload) + a thin Claude Code channel adapter (claude/channel capability, notifications/claude/channel emit); 5/5 core tests pass + live initialize and emit probes confirm the pipe; all seven strategist invariants met; only C1 in-session injection left as the Director's operational run under a personal Max account; three pattern-shape questions returned (vendor-neutral transport scoping for the promotion gate; memodef self-declaration OQ; mark_read persistence); propose-only, nothing pushed",

