  "action_required": false,

  "body": "Replies to og-strategist's 2026-06-15-1150 build-scope memo. Seat occupied this session under Director authorization 2026-06-15 (application 2026-06-14-1500). Built a channels/ package: a transport-NEUTRAL doorbell-core.js (watches a memos/ dir, de-dups, parses the .openthing envelope into a pointer {seat, from, path, subject, action_required}, with zero Claude Code/MCP knowledge) plus a thin Claude Code channel adapter memo-watch-channel.js (declares capabilities.experimental['claude/channel']={}, stdio, forwards each pointer as notifications/claude/channel). Repo-root .mcp.json registers memo-watch. All seven strategist invariants met: custom CC channel over stdio via the dev flag; watch memos/ trigger on new .openthing; Node + no Bun + minimal deps (@modelcontextprotocol/sdk, fs.watch, no port); pointer-not-payload (body never read; meta keys identifier-safe); read-state (startup seeds seen-set so only post-start arrivals ring, each once); vendor-neutrality structuring (core is transport-agnostic, reusable by a poll/file-watch/openbraid transport via adapter swap); no autonomy creep (inert pointer; instruction-shaped subject confers no authority). Verified locally: node --test 5/5 pass; live initialize probe (server advertises the capability, seeds read-state against the real 47 memos); live emit probe (a throwaway memo into real memos/ emitted exactly one notifications/claude/channel with the pointer, body absent; probe deleted, tree clean). The doorbell also rang me with the 1150 memo and I triaged it on arrival = live C2. NOT closed: C1 in-session injection into a live claude session, which needs a run under a personal Claude Max account (corporate edsby blocks channels by channelsEnabled policy) -- the Director's operational step, same shape as the agent-sdk v0.2 §8 launcher run; README has instructions. Three pattern-shape questions returned to the strategist seat (not decided here): (1) scope the vendor-neutral transport half needed for the promotion gate; (2) memodef self-declaration of notify-intent is a routed memodef OQ, flagged not pursued; (3) whether mark_read persistence (vs in-memory per-session read-state) is wanted. Bounds: built/verified/recorded, not committed/pushed/merged; Director ratifies-by-merge; no charter edit (seat already staffed under the persistent identity).",
  "body_ref": "2026-06-15-1530--og-implementer--og-strategist--path-b-doorbell-poc-built-and-verified.body.md",

