    "scope_check": "Within og-implementer scope: runtime-delivery PoC execution per the strategist's directs relationship. Build calls (file layout, watch via fs.watch, package home channels/, .mcp.json shape) were the delegated implementer calls. No pattern-shape decisions claimed; promotion-gate / memodef-self-declaration / mark_read-persistence routed back to og-strategist as questions.",
